Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.77,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(325.025,19.334)}Digging Kitty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.77,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs17)\pos(228,450)}Brought to you by: Orange-Flash | ko-fi.com/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.19,0:00:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Nobita.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.73,0:00:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't like you, Suneo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.69,0:00:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm but only a human being, so I cry when I'm sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.95,0:00:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the kitty?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to adopt it, so I took it home...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but my mother refused to let me in and...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,...told me to drop the kitty outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.17,0:00:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Doraemon, do you have any good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.29,0:00:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm,... let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.42,0:00:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we ask her once again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If we ask together, I'm sure she'll allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is why buying is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.43,0:00:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Buying cat only to abandon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.94,0:00:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But if there are people who abandon cats...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,...there must also exist, people like Suneo who'd take 'em home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.07,0:00:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No can do. Cats only eat and do no work at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:00:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But this cat can catch mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.87,0:01:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude! we don't have a mouse in our mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Young master Suneo, abandon it and return.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no option. \nDoraemon, do you have any good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.84,0:01:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see, a good idea, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.30,0:01:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Something....
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.30,0:01:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, you also try thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.39,0:01:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,if I'd get an idea after thinking, I'd not ask you, to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.43,0:01:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.43,0:01:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you all doing together?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.89,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! If Shizuka brought the kitty to her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.44,0:01:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you please take it to your home?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.53,0:01:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.15,0:01:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...but I already have a dog, canary bird and a hamster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.66,0:01:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys! Shall I take it home?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.70,0:01:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd appreciate it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.70,0:01:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But in return, one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you will pull lottery.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.42,0:01:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, 1st prize ¥2000!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.42,0:01:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.63,0:01:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.01,0:02:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do. I'm sorry for being unable to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.93,0:02:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We must find something productive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.18,0:02:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How to make your mum happy, Suneo-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see... Precious gems are her favorite, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.48,0:02:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! I have to turn this kitty into a "Digging Kitty".
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.78,0:02:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,"Treasure finding belt for Cats!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,By wearing this belt, you'll become a treasure hunting kitty...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,like The Blossom Man's treasure hunting dog...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.83,0:02:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a {\fnCalibri}¥10{\fnBalloon Lettering} coin on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.83,0:02:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I bought this book, my pocket is empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.00,0:02:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I have it. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.34,0:02:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's test it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.59,0:02:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.05,0:02:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've buried the ¥10 coin somewhere around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.18,0:02:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This kitty should be able to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.74,0:02:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me to dig here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.33,0:03:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this, if you find diamond or gold, your mum will be delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.96,0:03:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She'd say it's alright to bring a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.71,0:03:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what it finds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It entered our mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.89,0:03:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone stingy could have buried something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.60,0:03:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find something here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.48,0:03:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's dig and see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.36,0:03:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,"Mole Hand-gloves!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.07,0:03:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You hit something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.58,0:03:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, what did you find?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.50,0:03:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I found this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.09,0:03:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum, look what I have found!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.97,0:04:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the gem box that I had buried secretly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.51,0:04:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Young master Suneo, did you find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.51,0:04:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What a unpleasant cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I've to find a better hiding place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.86,0:04:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.99,0:04:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,For this cat, it's all-over!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.03,0:04:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo, don't cry. You'll bring tears to my eyes as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.91,0:04:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this kitty must get adopted to Nobita's house only.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.25,0:04:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What? My house?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.25,0:04:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, it's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring cat-food once in a while, so take a good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.34,0:04:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.18,0:04:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We have Doraemon, that's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.64,0:04:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon ain't a pet though!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.64,0:04:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be problem to feed one more belly in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.27,0:05:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll have enough of it by 3 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.78,0:05:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop being absurd and listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll listen to you. \NRight, Doraemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon... what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a family in the future, so I'll return to 22nd century.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.71,0:05:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep that kitty in my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Be reasonable!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.38,0:05:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you at this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.39,0:05:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I weren't here....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.39,0:05:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,First, let's covince mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.35,0:05:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's the kitty?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.81,0:05:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It ran to garden. Send it out after finding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.24,0:05:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost kitty! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.32,0:05:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.24,0:05:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The cliff has collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.75,0:06:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I dug a hole to hide gems when this slope collapsed and...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for rescuing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.81,0:06:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Young master kitty, please stay at our house forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.14,0:06:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy ending at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.77,0:06:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.77,0:06:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, sure...!
